Build a complete Payment Processing System that demonstrates:

	- Interface design
	- Multiple implementations
	- Loose coupling
	- Dependency injection
	- Polymorphism in action

1.IPaymentProcessor Interface:

	interface IPaymentProcessor
	{
    		void ProcessPayment(decimal amount);
    		bool ValidatePayment(decimal amount);
    		string GetPaymentMethod();
    		void PrintReceipt(decimal amount);
	}

2. Three Implementations:
	- CreditCardProcessor - Validates up to $50,000
	- PayPalProcessor - Validates up to $10,000

3. PaymentManager Class:

	- Uses IPaymentProcessor (dependency injection)
	- Validates before processing
	- Prints receipts
	

